{"id":"dbc8f9c21c763ad6","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/777_Post_代数逻辑.md","title":"777 Post 代数逻辑","display":"777_Post_代数逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"777-Post-代数逻辑\">777 Post 代数逻辑</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-参数与符号表\">1. 参数与符号表</h1>\n<p>固定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\n\\operatorname{const}_i\\ (i&lt;n),\\quad\n\\operatorname{cyc},\\quad\n\\operatorname{join},\\quad\n\\operatorname{meet},\\quad\n\\operatorname{delta}_i\\ (i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\n\\operatorname{const}_i\\ (i&lt;n),\\quad\n\\operatorname{cyc},\\quad\n\\operatorname{join},\\quad\n\\operatorname{meet},\\quad\n\\operatorname{delta}_i\\ (i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{const}_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\qquad(i&lt;n),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{const}_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\qquad(i&lt;n),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cyc}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cyc}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{delta}_i:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\qquad(i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{delta}_i:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\qquad(i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\mathbf c_i,NA,A\\vee B,A\\wedge B,\\delta_iA\">\\(p,\\mathbf c_i,NA,A\\vee B,A\\wedge B,\\delta_iA\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{const}_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\operatorname{const}_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cyc}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\operatorname{cyc}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{delta}_i(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\operatorname{delta}_i(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{const}_i)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{const}_i)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{delta}_i(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{delta}_i(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{Post}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\}\\)</span>，并令替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{Post}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{Post}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 送到唯一满足下列递归等式的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{Post}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{Post}(\\sigma)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{const}_i)=\\operatorname{const}_i,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{const}_i)=\\operatorname{const}_i,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{cyc}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=\\operatorname{cyc}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{delta}_i(A))=\\operatorname{delta}_i(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{delta}_i(A))=\\operatorname{delta}_i(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Post}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,Post}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Post}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,Post}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{Post}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,Post}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{Post}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,Post}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-Post-代数矩阵\">4. Post 代数矩阵</h1>\n<p>真值集合与指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{Post}=\\{k\\in\\mathbb N:k&lt;n\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{Post}=\\{n-1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{Post}=\\{k\\in\\mathbb N:k&lt;n\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_{Post}=\\{n-1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>常元解释为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_i^{Post}=i\n\\qquad(i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_i^{Post}=i\n\\qquad(i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义运算族的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_{Post}:\\mathsf V_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post},\n\\qquad\n\\vee_{Post},\\wedge_{Post}:\\mathsf V_{Post}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{Post},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_{Post}:\\mathsf V_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post},\n\\qquad\n\\vee_{Post},\\wedge_{Post}:\\mathsf V_{Post}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{Post},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_i^{Post}:\\mathsf V_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post}\n\\qquad(i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_i^{Post}:\\mathsf V_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post}\n\\qquad(i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>循环算子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_{Post}(a)=\n\\begin{cases}\na+1,&amp;a&lt;n-1,\\\\\n0,&amp;a=n-1.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_{Post}(a)=\n\\begin{cases}\na+1,&amp;a&lt;n-1,\\\\\n0,&amp;a=n-1.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>格运算为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\vee_{Post}b=\\max(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\wedge_{Post}b=\\min(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\vee_{Post}b=\\max(a,b),\n\\qquad\na\\wedge_{Post}b=\\min(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>判别算子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_i^{Post}(a)=\n\\begin{cases}\nn-1,&amp;a=i,\\\\\n0,&amp;a\\ne i.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_i^{Post}(a)=\n\\begin{cases}\nn-1,&amp;a=i,\\\\\n0,&amp;a\\ne i.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{Post}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{Post}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post}\">\\(\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf V_{Post}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{const}_i)=c_i^{Post},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{const}_i)=c_i^{Post},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=N_{Post}(\\overline v(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{cyc}(A))=N_{Post}(\\overline v(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{Post}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{Post}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{Post}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{Post}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{delta}_i(A))=\\delta_i^{Post}(\\overline v(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{delta}_i(A))=\\delta_i^{Post}(\\overline v(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{Post}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{Post}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{Post}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{Post})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{Post}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{Post}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{Post})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{Post}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{Post}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{Post}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{Post}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{Post}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{Post}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{Post}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{Post}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{Post}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\longrightarrow\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{Post}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{Post}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{Post}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{Post}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{Post}\">\\(\\Vdash_{Post}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{Post}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{Post}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{Post}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{Post}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是 Post 代数矩阵语义后承系统；因此不定义非空 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{Post}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post},\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post},\\operatorname{BV}_{Post},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post},\\operatorname{Ext}_{Post},\\equiv_{\\alpha,Post},\n\\mathsf V_{Post},\\mathsf D_{Post},\n(c_i^{Post})_{i&lt;n},N_{Post},\\vee_{Post},\\wedge_{Post},(\\delta_i^{Post})_{i&lt;n},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{Post},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post},\n\\Vdash_{Post},\\mathsf{Valid}_{Post},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{Post},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{Post}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{Post}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post},\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{Post},\\operatorname{BV}_{Post},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{Post},\\operatorname{Ext}_{Post},\\equiv_{\\alpha,Post},\n\\mathsf V_{Post},\\mathsf D_{Post},\n(c_i^{Post})_{i&lt;n},N_{Post},\\vee_{Post},\\wedge_{Post},(\\delta_i^{Post})_{i&lt;n},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{Post},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{Post},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{Post},\n\\Vdash_{Post},\\mathsf{Valid}_{Post},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{Post},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{Post}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是同时含全部常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf c_i\">\\(\\mathbf c_i\\)</span> 与判别算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_i\">\\(\\delta_i\\)</span>；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不只是 Post n 值逻辑的循环否定片段。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"777-Post-代数逻辑","text":"777 Post 代数逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-参数与符号表","text":"1. 参数与符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-Post-代数矩阵","text":"4. Post 代数矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承","text":"6. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\n\\operatorname{const}_i\\ (i<n),\\quad\n\\operatorname{cyc},\\quad\n\\operatorname{join},\\quad\n\\operatorname{meet},\\quad\n\\operatorname{delta}_i\\ (i<n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{Post}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{const}_i\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\n\\qquad(i<n),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cyc}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{Post}\\to\\maths